  "scope": {
    "zh": "本版采用IPIP控制点整体20条英文及正反键，是该公有领域表示版本，不是Rotter 29题强迫选择I-E、原Levenson IPC 24题或JobCannon 12原创题。没有另测内部、有权势他人、机遇三个子量表，也不从其名称推算本总分。计分不能证明实际掌控、责任归属、能力高低、自尊、乐观、健康、动机或工作表现。官网ESCS信度与相关属于原样本和呈现，不是本站中文、NA规则或个人结果验证；无本站常模、百分位、优劣及类型阈值。",
    "en": "This edition uses the twenty English items and key directions in the public-domain IPIP Locus of Control: Total representation, not Rotter’s 29-item forced-choice I-E, the original 24-item Levenson IPC or JobCannon’s twelve original items. It does not administer the separate Internality, Powerful Others and Chance subscales or infer this total from their names. Scores establish neither actual control, responsibility, ability, self-esteem, optimism, health, motivation nor job performance. ESCS reliability and correlations concern the original sample and administration, not validation of this Chinese trial, NA convention or an individual result. There are no local norms, percentiles, good/bad ratings or type cutoffs."
  },
  "instructions": {
    "zh": "按这些句子与你现在通常的自我描述是否符合，选择1非常不符合至5非常符合，不按希望成为的样子作答。英文为IPIP公开条目，中文为本站试译；句子中提到成功、能力或自在，是对看法的自报，不是网站断言你确实如此。不适用、资料不足或不愿回答可选独立项，不当中立或零分。20题都选择后呈现完整读法；只有20条全部有效才显示原始总分，不填写真实经历。",
    "en": "Rate how accurately each statement describes you as you generally are now, from 1 Very inaccurate to 5 Very accurate, rather than your preferred image. English items come from public-domain IPIP; Chinese is our trial translation. Success, ability and comfort statements ask for self-description, not a website assertion that these are objectively true. Use the separate option when inapplicable, insufficiently informed or preferring not to answer; it is neither neutral nor zero. Complete twenty selections for the full reading; a raw total requires all twenty ratings. No personal story is entered."
  }
